# Integration recipe (PROPOSAL — engine.py and pipeline.py are integrator-owned)

Worker C6-21 does not edit these files. The recipe below is the minimal
mechanical wiring for the private module
`src/solweig_light/radiation/cylinder_longwave.py`. Default demand is
FULL_DIAGNOSTICS, so an engine-only integration changes nothing for existing
callers; pipeline.py opts in to the primary profile for the private TIFF
driver.

Observable-scope boundary (proved in INDEPENDENCE_VERIFICATION.md): under
PIPELINE_CYLINDERS_ANISOTROPIC the returned public fields `Least, Lsouth,
Lwest, Lnorth` lose the Lcyl cardinal contributions (the `+=` sites are
skipped via the sentinel guard). The private pipeline never reads these
fields (pipeline.py:267-277); Tmrt/Ldown/Kup/Kdown/Lup/shadow and all carried
state are unchanged. Under FULL_DIAGNOSTICS and under every guard-failure
fallback (the reference returns real arrays, not the sentinel) behavior is
byte-identical to today.

