Notes:
- The unconditional `Lcyl_v2022a_by_demand` swap is behavior-identical under
  the default FULL_DIAGNOSTICS demand: it forwards to the existing compiled
  `patch_radiation.Lcyl_v2022a` with the same runtime block_pixels/parallel
  the current wrapper used.
- The sentinel identity guard also covers the fallback domain: unsupported
  inputs make `Lcyl_v2022a_by_demand` return the serial reference's real
  arrays, so the `+=` runs exactly as today.

