Notes:
- The holder is a per-process module global; the pipeline timestep loop runs
  inside the runtime worker process that executes Solweig_2022a_calc, so the
  opt-in lands in the same process as the kernel dispatch. If the integrator
  prefers scoped restoration, wrap the loop in
  `cylinder_longwave.demand_scope(...)` instead (requires reindenting the
  loop).
- The demand flag must not be exported through RuntimeOptions.as_dict or any
  public signature (D09); it is set programmatically by the private driver
  only.

